text = "I want the final stop before the Climb 
(planned to mostly be one big map)
to be a meeting between the player and V.
For most of the first visit to Desolate Highlands,
V's role as a general shopkeeper is taken by another character."

[node name="Label2" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=566018000]
offset_left = 108.0
offset_top = -139.0
offset_right = 591.0
offset_bottom = -82.0
text = "I want to make a reference to something specific here...
Maybe put V in an outfit familiar to those who have heard of a tale of twin tails,
and they shall ask \"Will you accept Ascension?\"
It's a more physically-oriented kind of ascension, but it's still quite a process."
